LanguageData.Cosmere_Roshar_NW_Letter_Text:
{PAWN_nameDef} has returned from the Nightwatcher's valley. {PAWN_pronoun} carries something new, and something missing.

Boon granted: {BOON}
Curse taken: {CURSE}

Both are permanent. Neither can be removed by ordinary means. This is the nature of Old Magic.
